    "title": "Semmes Fire Chief passes away - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By NBC 15 ,\n9 hours ago SEMMES, Ala. (NBC 15) — Semmes Fire Chief Kevin Brooks has passed away. The City of Semmes is saddened to share the passing of our Fire Chief, who faithfully served this community for many years. After a courageous battle with cancer, he passed away last night. Chief Kevin Brooks... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
